OL,3,GNEWSAMum of girl, 4, hurt by firework
OL,4,Amakes Bonfire Night safety plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a young girl who was hit
OL,7,Fby a firework and critically injured
OL,8,Fhave urged people to "stay safe" this
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FThe girl, who was four at the time, had
OL,12,Fbeen "so excited" to go and see
OL,13,Ffireworks for the first time on Bonfire
OL,14,FNight last year, her mother said.
OL,16,FHowever, she ended up on a life support
OL,17,Fmachine in hospital after the
OL,18,F"horrific" incident, which saw her
OL,19,Fstruck by the firework on Elm Street in
OL,20,FBurnley, where teenagers were captured
OL,21,Fin CCTV launching them like rockets.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
