OL,3,GNEWSAMum of girl, 4, hurt by firework
OL,4,Amakes Bonfire Night safety plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer mother has now pleaded with people
OL,7,Fto be careful as she described how her
OL,8,Fdaughter is now terrified of them and
OL,9,Fstill needs check-ups and to wear
OL,10,Fspecial support clothing as she
OL,11,Fcontinues to recover.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
